WEBVTT

NOTE
The Iguions attack — Edea animates the gate's gargoyle statues during the Deling City parade.
Duration: approximately 27 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.650
The ornate reptilian Iguion statues on the Deling gate shudder and come alive.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.350
The Iguions writhe down from their perches, fanged and clawed.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.350
One lands in the floodlit boulevard amid a panicking crowd.
